flowchart TB
    Browser[Web Browser]

    subgraph Frontend["Frontend Application"]
        UI[Recipe UI]
        FrontendState[Client State]
        ApiClient[Backend API Client]
    end

    subgraph Backend["Backend Application"]
        Routes[REST API Routes]
        Auth[Authentication and Authorization]
        RecipeService[Recipe Service]
        UserService[User Service]
        FavoriteService[Favorite Service]
        Validation[Input Validation]
    end

    subgraph Data["Persistent Data"]
        Database[(PostgreSQL Database)]
        Migrations[Database Migrations]
    end

    subgraph External["External Services"]
        RecipeProvider[External Recipe Provider]
        ImageStorage[Image Storage or External Image URLs]
    end

    Browser --> UI
    UI --> FrontendState
    FrontendState --> ApiClient
    ApiClient -->|HTTPS JSON requests| Routes

    Routes --> Auth
    Routes --> Validation
    Routes --> RecipeService
    Routes --> UserService
    Routes --> FavoriteService

    RecipeService --> Database
    UserService --> Database
    FavoriteService --> Database
    Migrations --> Database

    RecipeService --> RecipeProvider
    RecipeService --> ImageStorage